Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 18:17:22 +0330
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Settings: add a Blur effects switch to Display

One place to turn blur off for the whole phone: notification shade,
recents, dialogs and apps that ask for window blur. It flips
Settings.Global.DISABLE_WINDOW_BLURS, the same setting as "Allow
window-level blurs" in Developer options, and only shows up where
SurfaceFlinger can blur at all.
---
 res/values/cm_strings.xml                     |  5 ++
 res/xml/display_settings.xml                  |  8 +++
 .../BlurEffectsPreferenceController.java      | 50 +++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 63 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/com/android/settings/display/BlurEffectsPreferenceController.java

diff --git a/res/values/cm_strings.xml b/res/values/cm_strings.xml
index d0ccf42..0ed622d 100644
--- a/res/values/cm_strings.xml
+++ b/res/values/cm_strings.xml
@@ -202,4 +202,9 @@
     <string name="device_charging_title">Charging</string>
     <string name="device_charging_summary">Bypass charging, charge limit, schedules and speed</string>
     <string name="device_charging_keywords">bypass, charging control, charge limit, charging speed, fast charging</string>
